# Sheet (SHEET.PRG) session on the text shell: sh tests/shots.sh EMU SD sheet 21 T1 ...
# Shot times (s): 7.0 11.0 13.8 15.6 17.0 18.6
#   7.0  /programs/BUDGET.SHT: texts, numbers in their columns' formats, totals, shares
#   11.0 a formula being typed in E16: "=B17/" and a click on B16 puts its name in
#   13.8 the range B4:C8 selected with Shift + arrows (E16 now shows the result)
#   15.6 the Format menu
#   17.0 Format > 0 decimals for the selected columns B and C
#   18.6 column A made wider by dragging its header's right line
# The pointer starts at (320, 180); moves of at most 100.
1500 {esc}
+1500 sheet /programs/BUDGET.SHT\n
# to E16 (15 down, 4 right), then "=B17/"
8000 {down}{down}{down}{down}{down}{down}{down}{down}{down}{down}{down}{down}{down}{down}{down}{right}{right}{right}{right}
